<p id="p12.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#Pt0.A2.SS3" title="0.B.3 Wall-Clock Comparison ‣ Appendix 0.B EPBS Sensitivity Analysis ‣ Video Models Reason Early: Exploiting Plan Commitment for Maze Solving" class="ltx_ref">B.3 Wall-Clock Comparison</a><span id="p12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_leader">.</span><a href="#Pt0.A2.SS3" title="0.B.3 Wall-Clock Comparison ‣ Appendix 0.B EPBS Sensitivity Analysis ‣ Video Models Reason Early: Exploiting Plan Commitment for Maze Solving" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">0.B.3</span></a></p>
