<th id="Pt0.A2.T1.4.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">NFE needed</th>
<th id="Pt0.A2.T1.4.2.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">Time (min)</th>
